# PLACEHOLDER -- Hemp Harness: vanilla's white harness, in undyed hemp cloth.
#
# Both MATRICES are vanilla's, taken verbatim: `item/white_harness.png` and the happy ghast's
# `entity/equipment/happy_ghast_body/white_harness.png` (128x128, its UV sheet). The leather, the
# goggles' glass and the orange trim are left exactly as vanilla draws them, because every vanilla
# harness keeps them; only the white cloth -- every neutral grey pixel -- is retoned, and exactly
# the way hemp_wool.mctex retones white_wool: luminance over white_wool.png's range (212-254) onto
# hemp_fiber's C4A985 (mid) to E0CBB3 (highlight), continued past the mid end for the shading.
# Vanilla's leather also shifts a shade per colour; ours keeps the white harness's.
#
# Every linter finding on both is accepted: vanilla's own white harness raises the same ones --
# the icon's light direction, and the item findings on a sheet that is not an item.

